  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"single\"><ac:layout-cell><p><span class=\"conf-macro output-inline\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with <a href=\"https://craterapp.com/\">Crater</a> (version 6.0.6), an open source product. Through Crater, you can then manage Customers, Billing, Payments and invoice etc.&nbsp;</span><span>Before you start using Crater, you need to setup Crater as per your operational needs. This is only meant to be a guide for effectively working with the rest of Bahmni components (mainly EMR).&nbsp; For comprehensive guide on setup and usage of Crater, please refer to the <a href=\"https://docs.craterapp.com/\">Crater documentation</a>.</span></p><p><span>To install crater with Bahmni, please refer to Bahmni <strong>Lite</strong> Docker installation setup:&nbsp;<ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker\" ri:version-at-save=\"40\" /></ac:link> </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The pages listed below assist you to setup and configure Crater to work effectively in conjunction with Bahmni Clinical functions.</span></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"three_equal\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"icon\">false</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Sections</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"28bbf201-d4bb-472c-865e-0ceb60581fb2\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
      "representation": "storage",
