    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><span class=\"conf-macro output-inline legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://craterapp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crater</a> (version 6.0.6), an open source product. Through Crater, you can then manage Customers, Billing, Payments and invoice etc. </span><span>Before you start using Crater, you need to setup Crater as per your operational needs. This is only meant to be a guide for effectively working with the rest of Bahmni components (mainly EMR).  For comprehensive guide on setup and usage of Crater, please refer to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.craterapp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crater documentation</a>.</span></p><p><span>To install crater with Bahmni, please refer to Bahmni <strong>Lite</strong> Docker installation setup: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3117744129/Getting+Started+Quickly+with+Bahmni+on+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3117744129\" data-linked-resource-version=\"49\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Getting Started Quickly with Bahmni on Docker</a> </span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3111157761/image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1686818305354&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3111157761/image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1686818305354&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3197796392\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"3111157761\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"4\" data-media-id=\"98f0c53a-f377-493c-bb4f-6fa0bdd21b37\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3111157761/image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1686818305354&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=640 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/3111157761/image2023-6-15_14-8-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1686818305354&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The pages listed below assist you to setup and configure Crater to work effectively in conjunction with Bahmni Clinical functions.</span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout three-equal\" data-layout=\"three-equal\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"28bbf201-d4bb-472c-865e-0ceb60581fb2\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3110207654/Crater+Customization\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3110207654\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Crater Customization</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
